: 00112333-PHOTO-2026-04-10-21-07-00.jpg>", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-11T04:07:44Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "I shouldnt say low, preventing bigger price rises", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-11T04:12:23Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "do we have enough liquefaction capacity to export it? i thought it takes a while to add that capacity", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-11T04:12:37Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Yes thats the problem", "role": "confirmation", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-11T04:12:41Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "No LNG terminals", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-11T04:12:55Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Will take several months at least to bring online", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-11T04:13:21Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "So not able to supply other geographies", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-11T04:13:29Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Unlike crude and refined products ofc", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-11T04:13:33Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Which are going", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-11T04:13:58Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "so why are producers pumping more gas out? ‎", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-11T04:14:24Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "and crashing prices?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null,